# Vercel Deployment Storage was at 7.5/10 GB (2026-09-15) -- almost all of
# it was this one file, re-uploaded whole on every single deployment:
# data/gbfs_log/snapshots.csv alone is 100MB, and dashboard.html never
# fetches it (or anything else in data/gbfs_log/) at runtime -- it's pure
# pipeline input for pipeline/reliability.py, which runs locally and
# commits its OUTPUT (data/reliability.json, a few hundred KB) for the
# dashboard to actually read. Everything below this line is real,
# committed, needed by the pipeline or by a human working in this repo --
# just never served to a browser, so it has no reason to ship in a
# deployment. Confirmed each exclusion against dashboard.html's own
# fetchJSON()/href calls before adding it here, not assumed.

data/gbfs_log/
data/raw/
data/models/
data/data_manifest.json

# Python pipeline source, tests, and notebooks -- this is a static site
# with no build step; nothing here ever runs in the browser.
pipeline/
tests/
notebooks/

# The pre-rewrite v2 implementation CLAUDE.md keeps around for local
# "compare to reference" work -- not linked from dashboard.html.
reference/
